title":["Iṣṭa-deve Vijñapti"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["hari hari!","    viphale janama goṅāinu","manuṣya-janama pāiyā    rādhā-kṛṣṇa nā bhajiyā","    jāniyā śuniyā viṣa khāinu"],"translation":["O Lord! My life has passed uselessly. I attained a human birth, but I did not serve Rādhā and Kṛṣṇa. Knowingly I drank poison."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["golokera prema-dhana    hari-nāma-saṅkīrtana","    rati nā janmila kena tāya","saṁsāra-viṣānale    divā-niśi hiyā jvale","    juḍāite nā kainu upāya"],"translation":["Why didn’t I develop attachment to Hari-nām-saṅkīrtan, to Goloka’s divine love and wealth? My heart burns day and night in the poisonous fire of saṁsāra, yet I have not sought any way to relieve it."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["vrajendra-nandana yei    śachī-suta haila sei","    balarāma ha-ila nitāi","dīna-hīna yata chhila    hari-nāme uddhārila","    tāra śākṣī jagāi mādhāi"],"translation":["Vrajendra Nandan became Śachī Suta and Balarām became Nitāi. They delivered all the fallen souls with the Holy Name. Jagāi and Mādhāi are evidence of this."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["hā hā prabhu nanda-suta    vṛṣabhānu-sutā-yuta","    karuṇā karaha ei-bāra","narottama-dāsa kaya    nā ṭheliha rāṅgā pāya","    tomā vine ke āchhe āmāra"],"translation":["O Rādhā! O Lord Kṛṣṇa! Be merciful to me this time. Narottam Dās says, “Please don’t push me away from Your reddish feet. Without You, who do I have?”"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-hari-hari","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/hari-hari-biphole","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-xari-xari","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Iṣṭa-deve-Vijñapti-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/hari-hari-biphole-janama-goyainu/","description":"Iṣṭa-deve Vijñapti — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Iṣṭa-deve Vijñapti. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"hari-hari-biphole-janama-goyainu"}}